    "detailed_description": "Ever wondered what happens after you\u2026well, don\u2019t? In COLD TRAIL you play as a ghost investigating his own death. This beautiful world, flitting through vibrant landscapes and poetic settings hides a dark secret: your own demise.<br><br>COLD TRAIL is an adventure game focused on exploration, collecting clues, solving mysteries and puzzles. Featuring quirky characters to meet and many surprise to discover in a handpainted world. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/ae2cb2821245c90271a97ab17c4d2e3e.avif?t=1725992481\" width=548 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/2dc84417eda84519732782cc6a3ed3cf.poster.avif?t=1725992481\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/2dc84417eda84519732782cc6a3ed3cf.webm?t=1725992481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/2dc84417eda84519732782cc6a3ed3cf.mp4?t=1725992481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From the heart of the village to the deepest woods, a converted farm turned fortune-telling kiosk and a trailer park turned post-apocalytic bunker, every corner invites observation and exploration.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/502c3fe3bb98dbe5e9baad6ebe4676ec.avif?t=1725992481\" width=395 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/b29e8a9fdd5ce47066911c65bd9502e3.poster.avif?t=1725992481\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/b29e8a9fdd5ce47066911c65bd9502e3.webm?t=1725992481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/b29e8a9fdd5ce47066911c65bd9502e3.mp4?t=1725992481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You start the story as an amateur ghost, unfamiliar with the job. As the adventure progresses, you will master the role of a ghost and unlock ghostly abilities.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/15ca2acdff7f43804c13f83fa9a5b00d.avif?t=1725992481\" width=494 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/e6bc65035598dfdd88413c9bef36efe6.poster.avif?t=1725992481\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/e6bc65035598dfdd88413c9bef36efe6.webm?t=1725992481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/e6bc65035598dfdd88413c9bef36efe6.mp4?t=1725992481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this setting, where houses are spaced out, personalities have more room to develop. Memorable characters will cross your path. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/cc7fea4d181017645f9b84510ec70881.avif?t=1725992481\" width=543 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/f329ba40475c435631e134abbdc7750e.poster.avif?t=1725992481\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/f329ba40475c435631e134abbdc7750e.webm?t=1725992481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217040/extras/f329ba40475c435631e134abbdc7750e.mp4?t=1725992481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After receiving what might be a blow to the head, the cause of your demise eludes you. In search of answers, you return to Edward\u2019s Creek \u2014 where you passed away.",
